  "discussion": {
    "headline": "nother heatwave to scorch the mid-atlantic states this week",
    "dateLine": "1:00 p.m. Tuesday, July 14, 2026",
    "excerpt": "As anticipated last week, the second weekend of July wrapped up on a partly sunny and seasonably warm note with high temperatures in the mid 80s Sunday afternoon. The week then kicked off on an even nicer note with more sunshine, lower humidity and similar temperatures on Monday. Unfortunately, much hotter and somewhat more humid conditions have returned this afternoon, and another heatwave will bake northern MD and southeastern PA through the end of the week. …",
